But we need to use \old? Not needed, because we are at end of constructor, no old state. So just assert.

Thus assert (initialCapacity >= 0 && capacityIncrement >= 0) => this.size() == 0;

Make sure syntax: parentheses around antecedent.

So final answer:

<code>assert (initialCapacity >= 0 && capacityIncrement >= 0) => this.size() == 0;</code>

